Stop [E3010]: `Shifting left by 200 bits is out of range (this type is 8 bits wide)`
  --> over_width_shift_traps_cleanly.jet:2
 Why: The operands or position do not produce a valid result, so the safe runtime stops instead of returning corrupted data — with Jet file and line.
 Fix: Check the operands or bounds before the operation, or use a checked operation that returns an outcome.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3010
